{"scene_id": "s00070", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00070.fountain", "heading": "INT. ICE-TUG COOLANT GALLERY - DRIFT SHIFT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "TESS OKONKWO", "names": ["TESS OKONKWO", "TESS"], "gender": "?", "first": 3, "spoke": 6}, {"id": 1, "name": "BRANDR HALVORSEN", "names": ["BRANDR HALVORSEN", "BRANDR"], "gender": "m", "first": 3, "spoke": 6}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ICE-TUG COOLANT GALLERY - DRIFT SHIFT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Frost on every rivet.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Amber work lights flicker down a corridor choked with pipe.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "TESS OKONKWO (30s, burn scar across one palm, tool belt hanging low) drags a sled of frozen valve housings past a hatch while BRANDR HALVORSEN (50s, enormous, a thermos strapped to his chest like a medal) kneels at a leaking manifold, wrench in one fist, the other hand flat against the pipe as if feeling for a pulse.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Tess kicks the sled brake, taps the gauge, and taps it again.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Brandr doesn't look up.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "All hands on nine, gallery four is weeping coolant. Stay out of the aft ring.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["into her collar"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "No answer.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Static, then nothing.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of course. Of course you're all asleep.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["to herself"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hand me the forty.", "name": "BRANDR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "She slides a wrench across the deck.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "He ignores it and keeps his palm on the pipe.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's not leaking. It's breathing.", "name": "BRANDR", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Pipes don't breathe.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "This one's learned.", "name": "BRANDR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "The manifold gives a long, wet exhale.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "A white plume rolls across the ceiling.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Tess backs into the sled, Brandr rocks onto his heels, and the work lights die one by one down the corridor, leaving only the glow of the gauge.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Everyone brace. Pressure drop, thirty seconds.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the dark, loud"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Easy, girl. Easy.", "name": "BRANDR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["low, to himself"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The gauge needle sags, hovers, and slowly climbs.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "The lights stutter back.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Tess laughs once, short, and sits on the sled.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Brandr unscrews his thermos and pours steaming coffee into the cap, which he holds out to her without looking.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You knew it would settle.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "BRANDR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "She takes the cap anyway.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind them, the pipe begins to knock, slow and rhythmic, like someone asking to be let in.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Brandr.", "name": "TESS", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I heard it.", "name": "BRANDR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "The knocking speeds up.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "They both stand.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}]}